WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:01.501
President Biden just told

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.802
the allies that the U.S.

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:04.704
will support efforts

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:08.108
to train Ukrainian pilots on F-16

00:00:08.108 --> 00:00:08.808
fighter jets.

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:10.276
Solecki desperately

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:12.445
wants those planes inside his country.

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:13.980
We have team coverage,

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.115
beginning with CNN's

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:17.684
Natasha Bertrand at the Pentagon Natasha.

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:19.986
Tell us about this announcement

00:00:19.986 --> 00:00:23.456
the US will support training on the F-16.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.059
What exactly does all this mean

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:27.127
Yeah, John,

00:00:27.127 --> 00:00:28.294
this is a really significant

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:28.995
announcement here

00:00:28.995 --> 00:00:30.063
from the administration,

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:31.398
and it really marks a U-turn

00:00:31.398 --> 00:00:32.432
for President Biden,

00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:34.134
who just a few short months ago

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:35.502
had said that he did not believe

00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:37.670
that Ukraine needed F-16s at this time.

00:00:37.804 --> 00:00:39.773
Now, he has told G7 leaders there

00:00:39.773 --> 00:00:40.707
in Japan

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:41.941
that the US is prepared

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:44.444
to join a coalition of countries

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:45.745
to train Ukrainians

00:00:45.745 --> 00:00:46.312
on fourth

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:47.747
generation fighter aircraft,

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:49.616
which includes F-16s.

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:51.518
That will begin in the coming weeks.

00:00:51.518 --> 00:00:52.352
This training will and

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:55.021
is expected to take several months.

00:00:55.021 --> 00:00:56.890
But this had really been up in the air

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:57.757
about whether the US

00:00:57.757 --> 00:00:59.259
would actually support this.

00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:00.560
A lot of European countries

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.595
do have a supply of F-16s,

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:04.230
and they have expressed a willingness

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:06.199
and a desire to send them to Ukraine.

00:01:06.199 --> 00:01:06.866
And of course Ukraine

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:08.101
has been pleading for the jets

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:09.069
for several months.

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:10.036
But it was not clear

00:01:10.036 --> 00:01:11.237
whether the US would approve

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:12.505
the transfer of those jets,

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:13.306
which it has to do

00:01:13.306 --> 00:01:15.141
because of sensitive US technology

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:16.242
and that will now.

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:17.010
Not only are

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:17.444
we told

00:01:17.444 --> 00:01:18.912
that the US is prepared

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:20.246
to allow the allies

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:21.414
to export those jets,

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:22.348
they are also prepared

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:24.651
to join this coalition of trainers

00:01:24.651 --> 00:01:26.820
who will be instructing Ukrainian pilots

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:28.388
on these jets in Europe

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:29.222
in the coming months.

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:30.223
This training, importantly,

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:32.258
is not expected to actually happen

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:33.993
in the United States,

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:35.862
but it will happen in Europe

00:01:35.862 --> 00:01:37.464
and it will happen in conjunction

00:01:37.464 --> 00:01:39.299
with some of these European allies

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:40.667
who have been pushing

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:42.302
for this kind of training

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:44.070
and provision of jets to Ukraine.

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:46.406
Including the Netherlands and the U.K.

00:01:46.406 --> 00:01:47.006
John.

00:01:47.207 --> 00:01:47.607
All right.

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:50.176
The US not providing the jets exactly,

00:01:50.477 --> 00:01:52.645
but approving the transfer.

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:53.680
And most importantly,

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:55.682
by in on the training,

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:57.350
that is a major development.

00:01:57.350 --> 00:01:59.085
Natasha Bertrand at the Pentagon,

00:01:59.085 --> 00:02:00.186
thank you very much.

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:00.487
Let's go

00:02:00.487 --> 00:02:01.654
now to CNN's Mark Stewart,

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:04.257
who is with the president at the

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:05.125
the G-7 summit.

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:06.559
Mark, I have to say this announcement

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:07.560
about training

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:08.795
on the F-16s,

00:02:08.795 --> 00:02:10.964
I think eclipse in importance,

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:11.865
the other things

00:02:11.865 --> 00:02:13.099
that have been going on there.

00:02:13.099 --> 00:02:14.400
But when Zelensky arrives,

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.835
he'll be greeted with this information

00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:17.337
and some other information he'll like

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:21.608
Well, the information that

00:02:21.608 --> 00:02:22.742
he will certainly like

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:23.576
and had been hoping

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:24.911
for was an agreement

00:02:24.911 --> 00:02:26.312
by the G7 leaders

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:28.414
to really beef up sanctions

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:31.217
against Russia, an effort to quash

00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:33.586
and destroy the funding component,

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:35.622
at least of the Russian war machine.

00:02:35.688 --> 00:02:37.624
So today, a big announcement on sanctions

00:02:37.624 --> 00:02:38.324
and really

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:39.192
we can divide it up

00:02:39.192 --> 00:02:40.860
into two different categories.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:41.594
First,

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:43.663
things expect to see sanctions

00:02:43.897 --> 00:02:45.932
on manufacturing,

00:02:45.932 --> 00:02:48.268
things such as transportation

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:51.471
Is any kind

00:02:51.471 --> 00:02:54.541
of material effort, material item

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:56.009
that has been crucial

00:02:56.009 --> 00:02:57.143
that has allowed Russia

00:02:57.143 --> 00:02:59.112
to thrive In addition, the U.K.

00:02:59.112 --> 00:02:59.746
just today

00:02:59.746 --> 00:03:01.714
announced that it will prohibit

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:03.650
Russian imports of diamonds.

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:07.053
So that is going to be a big attack mode

00:03:07.053 --> 00:03:07.820
right there.

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:08.988
And then expect to see

00:03:08.988 --> 00:03:11.024
sanctions on individuals, either

00:03:11.324 --> 00:03:13.293
people who hold leadership positions

00:03:13.293 --> 00:03:13.793
in Russia

00:03:13.793 --> 00:03:15.361
or perhaps who have wealth,

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:17.530
who have been able to contribute

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:19.499
to the funding of the Russia,

00:03:19.499 --> 00:03:22.035
the Russian efforts in Ukraine.

00:03:22.302 --> 00:03:23.469
One final note, John.

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:25.205
When President ZELENSKYY comes here,

00:03:25.205 --> 00:03:25.939
not only will

00:03:25.939 --> 00:03:27.640
he meet with members of the G7,

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.642
but also other invited nations

00:03:29.842 --> 00:03:31.978
India, Indonesia, Brazil,

00:03:32.145 --> 00:03:34.981
those are nations that also could impact

00:03:35.181 --> 00:03:35.982
the Russian war

00:03:35.982 --> 00:03:37.016
effort, particularly

00:03:37.016 --> 00:03:38.351
on an economic front.

00:03:38.351 --> 00:03:40.086
So expect to see some of that

00:03:40.086 --> 00:03:41.921
to come up in conversation as well.

00:03:41.921 --> 00:03:44.824
So F-16s, F-16 training, sanctions

00:03:44.824 --> 00:03:45.892
and big meetings

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:47.894
with other important world leaders.

00:03:48.194 --> 00:03:49.696
This is indeed a big weekend

00:03:49.696 --> 00:03:51.164
for President Zelensky.

00:03:51.164 --> 00:03:53.132
Mark, terrific to see you in Japan.

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:54.133
Appreciate it.

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:55.735
So as the president

00:03:55.735 --> 00:03:56.970
and these G7 leaders

00:03:56.970 --> 00:03:59.472
work on these sanctions on Russia,

00:03:59.472 --> 00:04:00.206
Vladimir Solecki,

00:04:00.206 --> 00:04:02.508
he is traveling thousands of miles

00:04:02.508 --> 00:04:04.444
for this personal pitch for support.

00:04:04.444 --> 00:04:06.212
His first stop in Saudi Arabia

00:04:06.212 --> 00:04:07.447
this morning

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.215
A remarkable journey from Kiev.

00:04:09.215 --> 00:04:09.749
We had a map

00:04:09.749 --> 00:04:11.751
that shows just how far he's going.

00:04:11.751 --> 00:04:12.852
He meets with the crown prince

00:04:12.852 --> 00:04:15.688
in Saudi Arabia before going to the G7.

00:04:15.788 --> 00:04:16.155
CNN's

00:04:16.155 --> 00:04:17.056
Nic Robertson

00:04:17.056 --> 00:04:19.993
is following all this for us.

00:04:19.993 --> 00:04:21.027
And Nic, as we said,

00:04:21.027 --> 00:04:22.862
this is turning into a very

00:04:22.862 --> 00:04:24.530
fruitful journey for Zelensky

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:28.134
It is

00:04:28.134 --> 00:04:29.202
the meeting with the crown

00:04:29.202 --> 00:04:31.004
prince Mohammed bin Salman Big.

00:04:31.004 --> 00:04:33.206
It was Salman's invitation.

00:04:33.206 --> 00:04:34.107
Salman himself

00:04:34.107 --> 00:04:36.042
wants to have a bigger role

00:04:36.042 --> 00:04:38.111
in regional politics and in particular,

00:04:38.678 --> 00:04:40.179
diplomacy and helping

00:04:40.179 --> 00:04:41.281
bring peace to Ukraine.

00:04:41.281 --> 00:04:42.282
He said as foreign minister

00:04:42.282 --> 00:04:43.883
to Ukraine a few months ago,

00:04:43.883 --> 00:04:44.651
several hundred

00:04:44.651 --> 00:04:47.854
billions and humanitarian aid committed.

00:04:47.854 --> 00:04:48.855
Also,

00:04:48.855 --> 00:04:50.223
there is heavy investment

00:04:50.223 --> 00:04:52.492
between from Saudi Arabia and Ukraine.

00:04:52.492 --> 00:04:54.060
There certainly was before the war.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.628
And Saudi sees itself

00:04:55.628 --> 00:04:56.729
as part of a solution

00:04:56.729 --> 00:04:57.897
maker, has been involved

00:04:57.897 --> 00:04:59.565
in getting prisoners

00:04:59.565 --> 00:05:01.234
released, particularly foreign prisoners.

00:05:01.234 --> 00:05:02.702
So this is something that's big

00:05:02.702 --> 00:05:04.203
for members and for Zelensky.

00:05:04.203 --> 00:05:05.071
It really allows him

00:05:05.071 --> 00:05:07.373
to get under the skin in the Arab world

00:05:07.373 --> 00:05:08.941
and the Gulf states

00:05:08.941 --> 00:05:10.276
with Putin's narrative,

00:05:10.276 --> 00:05:11.044
which is quite often

00:05:11.044 --> 00:05:12.712
accepted there at face value,

00:05:12.712 --> 00:05:14.947
that Ukraine isn't really a country, it's

00:05:15.081 --> 00:05:16.549
really part of Russia,

00:05:16.549 --> 00:05:18.451
that Russia is actually

00:05:18.451 --> 00:05:19.952
being attacked by nature,

00:05:19.952 --> 00:05:21.888
that this is Western hedge money.

00:05:21.888 --> 00:05:24.090
Putin's message sells pretty well

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.525
on the Arab street and places

00:05:25.525 --> 00:05:26.426
people believe it was.

00:05:26.426 --> 00:05:27.794
Zelensky's

00:05:27.894 --> 00:05:30.296
ability now to speak to the Arab leaders

00:05:30.296 --> 00:05:30.963
and in particular,

00:05:30.963 --> 00:05:32.799
Mohammed bin Salman has huge value

00:05:32.799 --> 00:05:33.733
in disrupting

00:05:33.733 --> 00:05:34.834
Putin's sell

00:05:34.834 --> 00:05:36.569
more friends, potentially

00:05:36.569 --> 00:05:38.638
more help and support going forward.

00:05:38.638 --> 00:05:39.739
But I think what we're hearing

00:05:39.739 --> 00:05:42.975
from President Biden, from G7

00:05:42.975 --> 00:05:44.043
allies and partners

00:05:44.043 --> 00:05:45.445
that support Ukraine, particularly

00:05:45.445 --> 00:05:46.813
about the F-16,

00:05:46.813 --> 00:05:48.247
this narrative has been going on

00:05:48.247 --> 00:05:49.148
for a little while.

00:05:49.148 --> 00:05:50.416
It's been gaining momentum.

00:05:50.416 --> 00:05:50.850
The British

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:51.651
a few months ago

00:05:51.651 --> 00:05:53.519
said they would train F-16 pilots

00:05:53.519 --> 00:05:54.721
a couple of days ago,

00:05:54.721 --> 00:05:55.688
the Dutch and British prime

00:05:55.688 --> 00:05:56.856
minister said they would

00:05:56.856 --> 00:05:57.957
launch an initiative

00:05:57.957 --> 00:05:59.158
to help Ukraine source

00:05:59.158 --> 00:06:01.561
these F-16s and get pilots trained.

00:06:01.994 --> 00:06:03.830
But I think this reflects

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:04.630
perhaps President

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:06.099
Biden's shift reflects

00:06:06.099 --> 00:06:08.368
a real ground reality here, John.

00:06:08.401 --> 00:06:09.569
And the ground reality

00:06:09.569 --> 00:06:11.070
is something we've been seeing.

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:12.739
Every frontline commander

00:06:12.739 --> 00:06:14.107
we speak to here

00:06:14.107 --> 00:06:16.342
talks about a lack of ammunition.

00:06:16.342 --> 00:06:17.343
And when you come into this,

00:06:17.343 --> 00:06:17.877
you think, hey,

00:06:17.877 --> 00:06:19.245
maybe this is just part of shaping

00:06:19.245 --> 00:06:20.446
the information message.

00:06:20.446 --> 00:06:21.514
We need more help.

00:06:21.514 --> 00:06:22.882
But after a period of time

00:06:22.882 --> 00:06:24.417
here, you begin to think

00:06:24.417 --> 00:06:26.018
maybe this is genuine.

00:06:26.018 --> 00:06:27.720
And I think there's a recognition

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:28.621
that when the tanks

00:06:28.621 --> 00:06:29.989
were authorized for Ukraine,

00:06:29.989 --> 00:06:31.791
by the time they get to the tanks,

00:06:31.791 --> 00:06:34.160
this much talked about a big offensive

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:34.627
here.

00:06:34.694 --> 00:06:35.962
Hasn't started

00:06:35.962 --> 00:06:37.263
when when the West says

00:06:37.263 --> 00:06:38.431
we'll give you tanks

00:06:38.431 --> 00:06:40.299
and when Ukraine can put them into action

00:06:40.299 --> 00:06:41.567
takes a lot of time.

00:06:41.567 --> 00:06:43.803
And Russia gains advantage in that time.

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:46.272
So the recognition that F-16s

00:06:46.272 --> 00:06:47.573
are actually needed,

00:06:47.573 --> 00:06:49.075
Ukraine has said it needs them.

00:06:49.075 --> 00:06:50.543
But the reality is

00:06:50.543 --> 00:06:52.578
they do need them to win this fight.

00:06:52.612 --> 00:06:54.180
Now, this summer,

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:56.249
again, against the Russian military,

00:06:56.249 --> 00:06:58.184
I think that message is beginning

00:06:58.184 --> 00:06:59.085
to sink in.

00:06:59.085 --> 00:07:02.688
Ukraine needs to win this summer

00:07:02.688 --> 00:07:04.791
and it needs all this equipment now.

00:07:04.791 --> 00:07:08.628
That is something that is my takeaway

00:07:08.628 --> 00:07:09.729
at this period of time.

00:07:09.729 --> 00:07:10.797
We've had exclusive

00:07:10.797 --> 00:07:12.498
front lines here in Ukraine.

00:07:12.498 --> 00:07:14.267
Promise promises one thing. Action.

00:07:14.267 --> 00:07:15.868
A completely different matter.

00:07:15.868 --> 00:07:17.403
Nic Robertson, great to have you there.

00:07:17.403 --> 00:07:19.305
You and your team, please stay safe.

00:07:19.305 --> 00:07:20.573
Cedric Leighton is a CNN

00:07:20.573 --> 00:07:22.809
military analyst and retired U.S.

00:07:22.809 --> 00:07:23.943
Air Force colonel.

00:07:23.943 --> 00:07:25.711
And good to see you.

00:07:25.711 --> 00:07:27.580
F-16s

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:28.981
high on the shopping list

00:07:28.981 --> 00:07:30.116
for President Zelinsky.

00:07:30.116 --> 00:07:31.517
Why is it significant

00:07:31.517 --> 00:07:33.686
that Ukraine received these jets

00:07:33.686 --> 00:07:36.022
if they can, and what sets them apart?

00:07:36.022 --> 00:07:36.489
Right.

00:07:36.489 --> 00:07:37.924
Why would they be

00:07:37.924 --> 00:07:40.293
a game changer possibly in this conflict?

00:07:41.461 --> 00:07:41.828
Yeah,

00:07:41.828 --> 00:07:42.962
Paula, the interesting thing

00:07:42.962 --> 00:07:44.831
is a really interesting aircraft.

00:07:44.831 --> 00:07:47.133
It's been around for about 49 years.

00:07:47.934 --> 00:07:50.169
40 plus that it was really operational.

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:53.139
And it is a multirole fighter.

00:07:53.139 --> 00:07:54.841
So it can do both air to air

00:07:54.841 --> 00:07:57.310
and air to ground combat operations.

00:07:57.944 --> 00:07:58.811
So what that means

00:07:58.811 --> 00:08:00.112
is it's really versatile

00:08:00.112 --> 00:08:02.281
and can be used in many different ways.

00:08:02.582 --> 00:08:03.382
And it

00:08:03.382 --> 00:08:05.618
also is an aircraft, depending

00:08:05.618 --> 00:08:07.153
on how it's configured,

00:08:07.153 --> 00:08:09.455
you can potentially use its

00:08:09.455 --> 00:08:11.290
electronic jamming capability

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:11.691
to go

00:08:11.691 --> 00:08:13.526
after some of the Russian radars

00:08:13.526 --> 00:08:14.126
that are

00:08:14.126 --> 00:08:15.895
active in Ukraine

00:08:15.895 --> 00:08:17.730
and around the Ukrainian periphery.

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:19.832
So it's a very important aircraft.

00:08:19.832 --> 00:08:21.734
It's probably the best aircraft

00:08:21.734 --> 00:08:22.268
in terms

00:08:22.268 --> 00:08:24.136
of all the different capabilities

00:08:24.136 --> 00:08:25.905
that the Ukrainians would want.

00:08:25.905 --> 00:08:27.707
And it's probably the only aircraft

00:08:27.707 --> 00:08:29.609
that as all of those capabilities

00:08:29.609 --> 00:08:31.143
in one package.

00:08:31.143 --> 00:08:32.545
Now, when President Zelensky

00:08:32.545 --> 00:08:34.280
has asked for them,

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.581
the United States has said

00:08:35.581 --> 00:08:38.084
no, definitely not, at least not yet.

00:08:38.351 --> 00:08:39.318
EU allies,

00:08:39.318 --> 00:08:40.086
some of them seem

00:08:40.086 --> 00:08:41.521
to have a different policy

00:08:41.521 --> 00:08:43.022
especially in the last few months.

00:08:43.022 --> 00:08:43.756
Now, I want to point out

00:08:43.756 --> 00:08:44.924
that CNN reporting

00:08:44.924 --> 00:08:45.992
is that the Biden administration

00:08:45.992 --> 00:08:47.560
has now signaled to these allies

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:48.394
that, look,

00:08:48.461 --> 00:08:49.996
if you guys want to go ahead

00:08:49.996 --> 00:08:51.931
and give them these jets, export

00:08:51.931 --> 00:08:52.965
these F-16s,

00:08:52.965 --> 00:08:55.234
we may not stand in your way.

00:08:55.401 --> 00:08:56.769
Is this a huge policy

00:08:56.769 --> 00:08:57.904
change for the United States?

00:08:59.372 --> 00:09:00.840
Yeah, it's a policy change.

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:02.408
By, you know, little step,

00:09:02.408 --> 00:09:03.743
little incremental steps.

00:09:03.743 --> 00:09:05.678
And what it really means

00:09:05.678 --> 00:09:06.512
is that

00:09:06.512 --> 00:09:07.680
the Biden administration

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:10.049
is giving its tacit approval

00:09:10.049 --> 00:09:13.252
to its allies to provide these jets

00:09:13.252 --> 00:09:15.421
to the Ukrainians without any objection.

00:09:15.454 --> 00:09:16.622
So, A,

00:09:16.622 --> 00:09:17.823
what can happen here

00:09:17.823 --> 00:09:19.592
is that the pipeline is going to start

00:09:19.592 --> 00:09:20.293
and that pipeline

00:09:20.293 --> 00:09:21.827
includes everything

00:09:21.827 --> 00:09:24.830
from the aircraft itself to spare parts.

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:26.732
And most important, importantly,

00:09:26.732 --> 00:09:28.234
training for both the pilots

00:09:28.234 --> 00:09:29.201
and the maintenance crews

00:09:29.201 --> 00:09:29.936
that are going to have to

00:09:29.936 --> 00:09:31.137
maintain these aircraft

